     1351           cli-treal-8.netto-rubl CHR(9)
     1352           skip
     1353           .
     1354         end.
     1355         else do:
     1356           if v-text then do:
     1357             put stream PrnLibstream unformatted
     1358             0.0 format "->>,>>>,>>9.99" ':':U
     1359             0.0 format "->>,>>>,>>9.99"  ':':U
     1360             skip
     1361             .
     1362           end.
